    "lyrics": {
      "text": "I_ weep and___ I la--ment___ when__ I think up---on____ death, and be-hold___ our beau---ty, which was__ fash-ioned__ af---ter__ the__ im---age__ of___ God, ly-ing in the__ tomb dis-fig---ured,__ dis-hon-oured,____ be-reft__ of__ form.__ O won---der!__ What is this___ mys-ter--y that hath be--fall---en____ us? How have__ we__ been__ giv-en__ o----ver__ un-to cor--rup---tion? How have we been__ yoked__ to-geth---er__ with___ death? Of a truth, as__ it is__ writ----ten, it is by____ the__ com---mand__ of___ God, Who grant-eth rest__ to the___ de-part--------ed.____"
    }
